WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:35.460
By the way... for a low-profile trip abroad...

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:39.060
you seem to have brought too strong an escort...

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.720
I sense an assassin's shadow hanging over the Prince.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:49.670
Kajika!

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:02.170
No! Rumaty... run!

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:08.480
"Feelings for Someone"

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:12.360
Rumaty, run away! Rumaty!

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:23.190
A Royal Guard Officer who's devoted his life to the King...

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:25.840
is aiming a blade at one of the royal family?!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.780
Hey, what's wrong?

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:03.700
Your Highness!

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:06.990
Why are you hesitating now, Second Lieutenant Noei?

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:10.060
Husak... I...

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:13.350
There's no going back now.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:17.570
His Highness would probably be glad...

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:20.100
to die for the sake of the royal family.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.290
Rumaty!

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.130
His Highness Rumaty...

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:29.310
tragically lost his life at the hands of Hong Kong street kids.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:33.950
At least let's make it your hand, as a former officer of the Royal Guard...

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:37.330
that sends His Highness back to God.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:40.850
Okay?

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.780
Rumaty... Rumaty!

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.420
God, forgive me...

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:04.520
I'll pay for this sin with my own blood!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.780
Rumaty!!

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:34.690
Rumaty!

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.840
What are you doing?

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.330
It's no good, I can't...

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.610
I can't do it!

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:44.690
Bastard, after you've come this far!

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:46.370
I'll do it!

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.300
Stop!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:51.360
Shut it, coward! Step aside!

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:52.810
No, stop!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.050
Dammit. You! Do it!

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:00.290
No!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:11.320
Kajika, hide!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.750
Ip Yun!

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.570
Damn it all.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.600
I hear gunfire...

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:39.050
Stop trying to fight us! This is our turf!

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:40.520
Dammit!

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.450
Dammit...

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.190
they're firing wildly.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:56.900
If it's come to this...

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:00.820
at least I'll finish the job!

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:12.680
Rumaty!

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:29.030
Husak...

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.670
You double-crossed us, Noei...

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:44.880
Go make sure there are no more outside!

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.210
Yes, sir!

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:47.700
Miss Kajika!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.090
H--hey, stop!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.300
Miss Kajika...

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.530
Toranosuke, call an ambulance, quick!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:57.720
R--right. Get the helicopter here!

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:59.390
Understood!

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:01.290
His Highness Rumaty...

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:03.430
He's okay. He wasn't hit.

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:05.970
Thank goodness.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:08.310
Are you a friend of Kajika's?

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.140
The copter's here!

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.320
Good!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:16.680
Steady... hold on! The ambulance will be here soon!

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:19.010
Please open your eyes...

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:20.600
Please!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.400
That's right... strong... be strong!

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.880
Your Highness...

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:40.960
You're s--safe...

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:47.440
Please forgive...

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:51.320
I understand... enough now!

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.160
Don't try to talk!

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:56.970
I was...

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:00.040
a fool...

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.670
Now I want to help him.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.740
My brother is sickly, so I can help him...

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:35.400
and make Raginei everything God and the people could want.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.440
Rumaty...

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.420
Master Lee-Leng...

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.140
Please, don't scold her too harshly...

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:11.200
Miss Kajika has reflected on what she did...

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.340
Lee-Leng!

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:39.600
You really had me worried.

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.500
S--...

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.810
sorry...

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:59.330
I'm very pleased that both of them are home safe for now.

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:01.780
How is His Highness?

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:04.360
I want to see Rumaty. Please let me see him!

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:07.330
Thank you for your concern, but...

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:09.380
I'm very sorry...

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:12.280
right now His Highness needs to rest...

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:14.250
Oh...

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:18.060
If anything comes up, just let me know.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.630
Rumaty is my friend! I want to be helpful to him.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.970
Understood.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:33.640
Along with the man called Husak, there was one other who died immediately, wasn't there?

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.120
Correct.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:37.170
And what about the one who's still alive?

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:40.230
Second Lieutenant Isaac Noei.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:43.690
He's an officer of Crown Prince Somand's Royal Guard.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:45.910
Royal Guard?

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.020
Or he was a Second Lieutenant...

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:53.460
until he retired from the post two months ago.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.270
Why would someone so high-ranking...

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:59.690
He said it was for religious reasons.

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:05.520
He probably gave in to despair when he retired.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:12.050
Lee-leng, how badly is 2nd Lt. Noei hurt?

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:16.420
He lost a lot of blood, but it didn't hit any vital organs.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:20.460
Luckily the bone wasn't damaged, either, so he'll recover soon.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:24.450
Where is he now? In the hospital?

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:27.160
It's better if we keep this out of the public eye.

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.400
Doctors and equipment have been brought here to the estate.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:34.260
Really...

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:36.940
What is it?

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:39.670
Claiming 'religious reasons...'

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:42.300
It seems to me...

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:44.580
It's hard to believe that such a simple motive...

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:47.210
would make him target Rumaty's life.

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:51.020
That's why I want...

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:53.560
to ask him myself.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.370
2nd Lt. Noei...

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:05.980
please tell me the truth...

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:09.050
who was the ringleader?

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.450
2nd Lt. Noei...

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:16.500
I was not under anyone's orders.

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:21.460
I've known you for a long time, Lieutenant.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:24.090
Everyone respected and admired you...

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.040
I can't believe you would do something this foolish!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.730
Tell me the truth, Lieutenant!

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:35.350
I... acted alone.

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:39.240
Lieutenant...

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:44.590
May I come in?

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:46.330
Miss Kajika...

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:53.470
Do you remember me?

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:55.130
Yes...

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:58.160
I think you mistook me for Rumaty...

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:03.860
When you were shot... I was looking after you, and you mistook me for Rumaty...

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:09.170
Thinking I was Rumaty...

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.570
you apologized with all your heart.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:15.270
You? And His Highness?

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:17.940
I did?

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:19.060
Mm-hmm.

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:22.560
Idiot...

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:25.520
just how hazy did things get...

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:32.370
But really, now that she mentions it...

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:37.690
it's not just the shape...

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.060
I get this feeling somehow...

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:47.690
Even hanging between life and death....

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:51.140
you were more anxious for Rumaty than for yourself.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:52.470
I believe...

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:55.720
that was your true face.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:59.260
Who are you covering up for?

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:06.530
Whoever they are, for their sake...

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:08.650
you're going to take all the blame?

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.700
Is that really going to help them?

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.230
That's a lie!

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:22.060
My brother isn't trying to kill me!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:27.380
Noei is an officer under the direct control of His Highness the Crown Prince Somand.

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.720
There is no room for doubt.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.070
It's all a big lie.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:35.570
My brother would never do a stupid thing like that!

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.690
Your Highness.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.460
However harsh it may be...

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:44.390
you can't close your eyes to this!

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:46.410
His Highness the Crown Prince...

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:48.920
tried to take Your Highness' life!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:52.900
Understand the truth and deal with it.

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:54.660
You mustn't be frightened.

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:57.470
That's your duty if you're worthy of being King!

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.140
King?

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:02.480
What are you saying?

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:10.130
My brother is the one who will be King.

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.460
...the one who will be King...

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:15.960
Your Highness!

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:22.010
The one who'll be King is you...

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:24.050
my Lord!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.390
Afraid of his own shadow...

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.490
oblivious to the country's crisis...

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:32.970
a fool and a traitor!

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:36.540
You aren't fit to be King!

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:39.740
But you'll go this far to get the throne...

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:41.290
Crown Prince Somand?!

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:48.400
However you look at it...

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:51.320
His Highness Rumaty is the one cut out to be King.

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:54.790
If it's come to this, I can fight dirty, too.

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:58.610
I will see Rumaty on the throne!

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.620
So he won't say anything...

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.950
I felt the Lieutenant's resolve.

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:10.920
If we pursue it any further...

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:14.060
without a doubt, he'll sacrifice... his own life...

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:18.170
Your Highness, please wait!

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.750
--Hey, let me go!
--Your Highness!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:23.400
Rumaty, you're feeling better?

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.050
Please stop!

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.350
Where are you going?

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:30.760
Wherever Noei is! I'm going to ask who gave the order!

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.190
Stop!

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.340
He won't tell you! He'll never tell!

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.710
Question him now, and he may die for it!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.830
Let him die, then!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:47.290
But first he'll give me that name!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.640
Why?

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.210
Why don't you get it?

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:00.830
He's not someone who can be coerced!

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:05.540
When he saved your life, it must have been his choice in the end!

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:09.940
Why are you forcing him to make another painful choice?

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.550
There's no compassion in you!

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:22.180
Out of the way!

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:25.910
Rumaty!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.090
Even hanging between life and death....

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:36.800
you were more anxious for Rumaty than for yourself.

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.460
I believe...

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:41.670
that was your true face.

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:44.070
That girl...

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:45.960
Huh?

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:48.070
You mean Miss Kajika?

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:49.990
Kajika...

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:51.780
her name is Kajika...

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.880
Stop it, don't you understand? Rumaty!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:00.840
Your Highness!

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.010
Lieutenant, your arm!

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:16.730
Lieutenant...

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:25.110
You know what I want to hear.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.030
I am fully prepared.

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:33.040
What happened was that, for my own reasons...

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:37.530
I gathered a group and planned Your Highness' assassination.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:42.660
That I got a foreigner involved in my plans, I deeply regret.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.060
Foreigners?

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:47.960
Yes.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.860
Husak, who died...

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.440
pretended to be a religious extremist from Raginei...

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:55.600
but he was the pawn of an American company.

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:59.860
A group that's after our resources in Raginei?

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:02.520
Yes.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:06.270
The truth is they wanted to eat away at Raginei's royal family.

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:09.200
In order to gain an advantage in the struggle for natural resources...

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:13.560
it seems they hoped to divide the royal family.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:17.230
If you knew all that, why did you target me?

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:22.480
When it was all over...

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:25.920
I never intended to send them home alive.

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:30.030
From the beginning, it was my intention...

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.480
that I, too, would be utterly destroyed.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:35.520
A fine soldier's spirit you have...

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:37.450
Noei.

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:41.240
Your Highness, please stop this. His wound has reopened...

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:44.280
You said you were fully prepared...

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:46.690
Yes.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:49.920
Sezun, give me your sword.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.460
What are you saying?

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:57.360
Rumaty... Noei!

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:00.210
Lieutenant!

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:11.680
2nd Lt. Noei...

00:20:12.510 --> 00:20:14.170
Your Highness...

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:27.590
Your Highness!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.010
Miss Kajika...

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:33.320
I'll ask you one last time.

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:36.630
Did you plan this alone?

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:39.800
Yes.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:45.840
You're saying you weren't under anyone's orders?

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:48.840
Yes.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:52.680
My younger brother...

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:55.020
Rumaty... kill him.

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:02.220
Yes. The plot was mine alone.

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:06.260
Your Highness!

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.420
The scabbard...

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:15.240
Lieutenant...!

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.440
Enough...

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.660
That's enough!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:29.320
Nothing happened.

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:31.530
This is over!

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:37.510
Disappear.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:42.000
Y--your Highness...

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:45.820
You are never to set foot in Raginei again.

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:48.390
Go anywhere, just get out of my sight!

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.210
Rumaty!

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:56.910
Y--your Highness...

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.460
Lieutenant, hurry, lie down... you're bleeding...

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.890
Such precious words for someone so worthless...

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:11.000
As long as I live...

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:13.280
I won't forget this kindness.

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:22.270
Rumaty!

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:25.290
Stay out!

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:29.600
Rumaty...

00:22:30.720 --> 00:22:32.120
No one can see.

00:22:33.640 --> 00:22:36.620
The tears of the King's son...

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:42.530
aren't something I can let anyone see...

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:46.600
Now I know for sure...

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.000
the attempt on my life...

00:22:54.730 --> 00:22:56.700
came from my big brother.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
